            "review_title": "Review at Terrasse Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Ray Ray Ray\nDubai, United Arab Emirates936 contributions\n0\nGreat experience! Will definitely come back.\nApr 2023 • Couples\nThis review deals with an experience at the lobby bar aptly named Terasse.\n\nStopped in for a meeting with friends which turned into happy hour (2 for 1 drinks), cigars and a cheese plate.\n\nWe were seated outside for the duration on a mild evening. Not once did I feel uncomfortable or too hot.\n\nThe cold cuts and accompanying cheese were in sufficient quantities and quality which is somewhat of a rarity in Da Nang.\n\nThe accompanying fry bread was fresh, tasty and the perfect combination. I appreciate that the staff were able to top up our basket quickly and at no extra charge.\n\nService was affable and attentive and we always felt taken care of.\n\nCouple comments that might improve the experience,\n\n1) would be nice to have the appropriate ashtrays and paraphernalia for cigar smoking (depending on hotel smoking policy - neutral)\n\n2) would similarly be nice to know which receptacles on the table were for ice and which were for drinking - over the course of a couple hours, there was some confusion on the subject - sometimes we accompanied our drinks with soda water, other times, melted ice (neutral).\n\nOverall, a very good experience. An inviting property. Always felt welcome. Decent food based on my limited experience. 5/5\n\nWill definitely come back.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten April 3, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
